items.content:
The art world's gender gap isn't primarily about demand. It's about access.
@YaleSOM's Magnus Resch finds that women are less likely to enter the small circle of influential institutions that shape long-term careers, a gap that shows up early and compounds over time.
Read more: bit.ly/4vWBba1

